    "name": "Optimised Efficiency",
    "text": "Use in your Movement phase, just after one of your ADEPTUS MECHANICUS units ends a Fall Back move. Until the end of the turn, that unit is eligible to shoot and to declare a charge even though it Fell Back.",
    "cost": 1,
    "category": "strategicPloy",
    "phases": ["movement"],
    "window": "movement.unitMoved",
